.TH NESTED-BARE-VALUES 1 "2026-10-26" "BetterMan regression fixture"
.SH NAME
nested-bare-values \- nested argument values are not command options
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-proto
Protocol modifiers, as in Ubuntu curl:
.RS
.TP
.B +
Permit this protocol.
.TP
.B \-
Remove this protocol.
.RE
.TP
.B \-\-field
Field selection, as in numfmt:
.RS
.TP
.B \-
All fields.
.RE
.TP
.B \-\-compat
Compatibility entries, as in nsswitch.conf:
.RS
.TP
.B +
Include entries.
.RE
.TP
.B \-
Read standard input, as in su and shutdown.
.TP
.B \-\-
Stop option processing, as in sudo.
.TP
.B +
Relative alarm time, as in leave.
